e\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Harshail Hornbill?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Harshail Hornbill has 1 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Harshail Hornbill?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Harshail Hornbill is Under construction.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Harshail Hornbill?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Landscape Garden, Party Lawn, Senior citizen Area, Yoga Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Harshail Hornbill?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Harshail Hornbill is Harshail Group.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Harshail Hornbill\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/280822015837-newproject-2022-08-28t135827769.png\",\n  \"description\": \"Harshail Hornbill is a premium residential project in Malad West, Mumbai, designed for modern urban living. The project offers spacious 1 BHK homes thoughtfully planned to combine comfort, convenience \u0026 lifestyle. Strategically located on Pannalal Ghosh Marg, the development provides excellent connectivity to Mumbai’s best malls, international schools, colleges, a central business district (Mindspace), fine dining restaurants, entertainment zones, sports complexes \u0026 the metro railway station. With a picturesque beach in close proximity \u0026 vibrant surroundings, Harshail Hornbill Malad West presents an ideal opportunity for homebuyers \u0026 property investors seeking premium homes in Mumbai that perfectly balance city life with comfort \u0026 convenience.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Harshail Group\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/harshail-hornbill\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"9595000.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"9595000.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/harshail-hornbill\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800029350\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/harshail-group-1a256b13a638\",\n    \"name\": \"Harshail Group\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/harshail-hornbill\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Harshail Hornbill\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/harshail-hornbill\",\n      \"name\": \"Harshail Hornbill\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Harshail Hornbill, PG Road, off New Link Road, Somwari Bazar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Malad West\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400064\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Harshail Hornbill is a premium residential project in Malad West, Mumbai, designed for modern urban living. The project offers spacious 1 BHK homes thoughtfully planned to combine comfort, convenience \u0026 lifestyle. Strategically located on Pannalal Ghosh Marg, the development provides excellent connectivity to Mumbai’s best malls, international schools, colleges, a central business district (Mindspace), fine dining restaurants, entertainment zones, sports complexes \u0026 the metro railway station. With a picturesque beach in close proximity \u0026 vibrant surroundings, Harshail Hornbill Malad West presents an ideal opportunity for homebuyers \u0026 property investors seeking premium homes in Mumbai that perfectly balance city life with comfort \u0026 convenience.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"335\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"335\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/280822015837-newproject-2022-08-28t135827769.png\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Harshail Hornbill\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800029350\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Harshail Hornbill Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/harshail-hornbill\",\n      \"price\": 9595000.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"aiReviewSummary":{"summary":"General Satisfaction: The majority of buyers and residents praise the project for delivering modern, well-designed spaces that optimize carpet area effectively. Connectivity Advantage: Reviewers highlight the convenient location due to its close proximity to major transport hubs, essential services, and popular leisure spots. Infrastructure Realities: Multiple online inputs shed light on regular issues relating to heavy traffic jams and excessive noise in the immediate neighborhood.","pros":[{"title":"Metro Connectivity","description":"The property is located less than one kilometer away from the Malad West Metro Station, making daily transit highly efficient."},{"title":"Lifestyle Convenience","description":"Major shopping landmarks like Infiniti Mall and multiple educational institutions are situated within walking distance or a short drive."},{"title":"Functional Architecture","description":"The units feature zero space wastage layouts designed in accordance with Vastu principles to optimize utility."},{"title":"Modern Amenities","description":"Residents have access to unique terrace facilities including a rooftop yoga deck, reflexology pathways, and a children play area."}],"cons":[{"title":"Traffic Congestion","description":"The surrounding roads, particularly during peak hours, are prone to heavy traffic and bottlenecking."},{"title":"Sound and Air Pollution","description":"Due to the high population density and constant movement of vehicles, noise and pollution levels remain elevated."},{"title":"Space Constraints","description":"The plot size spans less than half an acre, resulting in limited open green spaces on the ground level."},{"title":"Parking Bottlenecks","description":"Scarcity of dedicated open visitor parking inside or directly outside the premises causes frequent inconveniences."}],"verdict":["Good value for money","Great for working professionals near Mindspace","Avoid if you prefer large open green townships"]},"googleReviews":null},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/projects/[project_name]","query":{"project_name":"harshail-hornbill"},"buildId":"t4LZHlTlBLViwyNa5GApO","isFallback":false,"gssp":true,"appGip":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>